    <li>American Academy of Pediatrics (2018), <a href={A} rel="noopener">The Power of Play</a>.</li>
    <li>Bredikyte and Brandisauskiene (2023), <a href={P} rel="noopener">pretend play and development</a> (open access).</li>
    <li>Moya-Higueras et al. (2023), <a href={B} rel="noopener">board games and skills</a> (open access).</li>
    <li>World Health Organization, <a href={H} rel="noopener">guidelines on physical activity, sedentary behaviour and sleep for under-5s</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These links go to the original sources. Some are academic publisher pages; where an open-access copy exists it is noted.</p>
</Legal>
